    "_discoveryComment": "Controls the 'new directions' feature — roles outside her current title. A posting whose title names a roleFamily always qualifies. A posting with no recognisable title must instead evidence discoveryMinCapabilities distinct abilities, which is what keeps keyword coincidences out. discoveryFloor lifts these clear of the 'possible' band so they are actually seen; incumbentTitleWeight is how core an existing title must be to outrank a new-direction label, and roleFamilyTitleWeight is what a family title is worth on its own.",
